member.remarks:
             This value is a snapshot of contention pressure observed at the instant of the read and is intended only for diagnostics, monitoring, or scheduling guidance.

It is therefore 0 in a purely Concurrent scenario;
once Exclusive pressure exists, it reports the currently observed combined Concurrent + Exclusive pressure.

